 5	// Which signed-in user each Neatlogs trace belongs to, in data/auth.db (own connection, same file
 6	// as Better Auth). The Neat Bot uses it to let non-admins open only their own traces, because
 7	// Neatlogs' trace tools return no session or user. Rows come from two places: web requests
